[[include info:start]]
**SCP-9837:** Plane-ly Ridiculous
**Author:** [[*user aismallard]] ([[[aismallard|Author Page]]])

Funny enough, I wrote this draft while on a plane.

Coldposted.
[[include info:end]]

**Item #:** SCP-9837

**Object Class:** Neutralized

**Special Containment Procedures:** Recovery of the remains of SCP-9837 and SCP-9837-1 is presently hindered due to the ongoing standoff near the location of its death. MTF-Gamma-5 ("Red Herrings") is currently engaged with the present information security situation.

**Description:** SCP-9837 was a Class-II semi-corporeal fascination sprite,[[footnote]]A class of entity colloquially called a "trickster spirit".[[/footnote]] which first came to Foundation attention after appearing at Site-19 and taunting researchers before demanifesting. Later analysis was able to translate the entity's speech as containing a threat to release highly-classified information, including four dozen Level-5 SCP files and [DATA EXPUNGED] concerning the Overseer Council.

The reproductive cycle of Class-II entities like SCP-9837 involve the build-up of energy following an appearance event, followed by a release of all its energy, occurring simultaneously with its threat(s) being carried out. The power of an entity's abilities is directly proportional to the number and importance of individuals feeling frustration or upset at its existence or actions.

However, elimination of the entity could not be performed, as it later entered the body of Yazuv Keleş (designated SCP-9837-1), a male Turkish national, which for unclear reasons left both SCP-9837 and SCP-9837-1 invulnerable. Following several abortive attempts to contain SCP-9837-1, he was administered aerosol amnestics and subject to non-interfering continual surveillance.

**Addendum 9837-1:** Termination Log

[[div class="blockquote"]]
= **Task Force Action Report**

**Background:** Thaumaturgical analysis of SCP-9837 has revealed that its explosion event will occur at exactly 20██/11/27 13:21:35 UTC, shortly before which SCP-9837 will become vulnerable to standard neutralization methods for Class-II entities. Unfortunately, intelligence reports have indicated that SCP-9837-1 has booked a commercial flight and will be in the air at that time.

**Procedure:** Mobile Task Force Gamma-1 ("Search and Destroy") will be placed on Air France flight ████ from Charles de Gaulle Airport (CDG) to Istanbul Airport (IST). The task force is to remain undercover until shortly before the specified time, at which point they will equip their weapons and terminate SCP-9837. Following confirmation of the anomaly's neutralization, the task force is then to amnesticize all passengers and crew.

**Transcription Notice:** All dialogue has been translated to English.[!-- this should be whatever language the reader is reading in --]

= **<Begin Log>**

//(It is five minutes prior to the predicted time. Members of MTF-Gamma-1 quietly equip their weapons and get into position.)//

**Agent Jones:** //(shouting)// Okay everyone! We're from an international task force, here to eliminate a threat to mankind. Please remain in your seats!

**Agent Güler:** //(aiming his thaumaturgically-enhanced rifle at SCP-9837-1's head)// Alright team, get ready in one, two...

**SCP-9837-1:** Woah, woah, woah, what the hell?

//(Two men and a woman in business clothes suddenly stand up. They are carrying thaumic weaponry.)//

**Man in Suit:** Stop right there criminals! We are from the Global Occult Coalition, a United Nations-designated organization for the protection of humanity from the paranormal, and //we// are the ones who will liquidate KTE-5297-Blue-Dictus for the threat it represents to normalcy and Coalition security.

**Agent Jones:** Wha--, blue dick -- Wait a second, we're not the Insurgency, we're the Foundation. //We// found this asshole and //we're// going to be the ones who kill it!

**Man in Suit:** Oh. Well, still, we're the experts on liquidating parathreats. Leave this to us.

//(Two men wearing cargo shorts stand up.)//

**Man with Floral Pattern Shirt:** Sorry kids, we are with the Pentagram. Executive Order ███ clearly authorizes us to kill this asshole and bring its body back to the United States for conspiracy to commit crimes against the US government. Unless you want us //(turns to the Foundation agents)// to revoke your site authorizations and //(turns to the GOC agents)// to make trouble in the Council of 108, you'll //both// stand down.

**SCP-9837-1:** Who the fuck are all you people?

//(Three men wearing T-shirts and jeans stand up. They remove thaumaturgically-enhanced handguns from their bags and varyingly point them at all other operatives.)//

**Man with Mickey Mouse Shirt:** Actually, the ORIA will be taking this man's corpse, as well as all the information in it.

**Other Man with Floral Pattern Shirt:** No, no, you won't. //(looking to his partner)// Jim, let's just kill the Iranians and be done with it.

//(In response, all three ORIA operatives point their weapons at the Pentagram agents.)//

**Unidentified Man:** //(unexpectedly standing up)// No! //I// will have it! Ambrose Restaurants will capture this ingredient and make for an //explosive// meal! Also, it threatened to reveal my magic meatball recipe.

//(Multiple operatives from all represented groups shoot the man.)//

**Man in Suit:** Screw that.

**Man with Mickey Mouse Shirt:** Yeah, agreed.

**SCP-9837-1:** Uh, guys?

**Man in Suit:** Shut up, we're not talking to you.

**SCP-9837-1:** I don't feel so good...

//(Recording is abruptly terminated as SCP-9837 explodes.)//

= **<End Log>**

**Afterward:** The plane was destroyed by the explosion, though Agent Güler managed to survive long enough to transmit the audiovisual recording before expiring. Mobile Task Force Phi-7 ("Skip Tracers") was deployed to secure the anomaly's remains, but found the area contested by operatives from the Global Occult Coalition, the Office For the Reclamation of Islamic Artifacts, and the United States military.

Due to the failure of any of the organizations present to neutralize SCP-9837 prior to its release event, a large amount of damaging material was released publicly onto the internet. RAISA has been tasked with archiving all such information concerning other organizations, while working with MTF-Gamma-5 to suppress information about the Foundation.
[[/div]]

